      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/25-perchlike-fishes/nanochromis-cf-teugelsi-2/",
      "html": "<p>Sandy bottom in places, caves and low-germ water are the basic requirements for successful care and breeding.</p>"
